<title>UK: McAlpine to announce Raine bid talks-paper.</title>
<headline>McAlpine to announce Raine bid talks-paper.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>British construction group Alfred McAlpine Plc will announce this week that it is in talks to buy housebuilder Raine Plc, valued in the share market last week at 35 million pounds, the Sunday Times newspaper said.</p>
<p>On Saturday The Financial Times had also said McAlpine was the prospective bidder, with its eye on Raine's land bank.</p>
<p>Raine announced a week ago that it was in talks with an unspecified firm which could lead to a takeover offer. -- London newsroom, +44 171 542 7717</p>
